  "sources": [
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Warrior's Soul",
          "desc": "Gains immunity while using skills. Gains Battle Spirit upon entering combat, using Basic Attacks or skills. Battle Spirit increases damage reduction. Attack Speed increases at max Battle Spirit. When out of combat, Battle Spirit will diminish while restoring Health."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Burst Ram",
          "desc": "Charges in the target direction, dealing damage and launching enemies in the path. Passive: Every 2 Basic Attacks, enhances the next Basic Attack to deal extra damage."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Magma Slam",
          "desc": "Gains a shield.Slows nearby enemies a certain range.After a brief delay, deals damage to enemies in range."
        },
        {
          "type": "Ultimate",
          "name": "Tremor Smash",
          "desc": "Leaps to the target location and hammers the ground 3 times. The first 2blows deal damage and slow enemies, while the 3rd blow deals damage and launches enemies."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "Very tanky",
          "Excellent AOE crowd control",
          "Strong engage"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "Predictable engage",
          "Low damage",
          "Needs team to follow up"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\nAt level 1, you want to take Skill 2 and start in the mid lane. With your tankiness, you can walk up and hit all the minions with Skill 2 to help your mid lane clear the wave. After, you want to go to the farm lane to protect your carry. Remember that Skill 1 cooldown can be reset when you hit Skill 2 so you can Skill 1 > Skill 2 > Skill 1 for free damage during the early game.\n\n## Teamfights\nIn teamfights, you want to be the main initiator. You have great AOE knockups with both Skill 1 and your Ultimate. When using your Ultimate, if the enemies are trying to escape, you can flash at the last second to reposition your knockup to surprise enemies in fights. This initiation alone can win teamfights for your team. You can also combo your knockup with Frigid Charge to stun enemies when they land back from your knockup, making it impossible for them to escape.\n\n## Tips & Tricks\nYou can flash during the 3rd strike on Lian Po's Ultimate to reposition so you can hit his knockup\nSkill 1 can be used to dash over walls\nIf enemies are within range when charging Skill 2, Skill 1 resets for an extra dash\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "Jadi gini, skill Lian Po cooldown-nya lama. Pas lagi cooldown, poke aja biar pasifnya gak nyerap banyak damage. Tapi ingat, jaga posisi dan simpen dash buat cepet keluar dari jangkauan skill-nya biar gak di-control terus."
    },
    {
      "source": "HoKStats",
